    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "(Non reperiuntur istius concilii canones vel decretum, sed finitis quae scribit de Laurentio archiepiscopo Cantua- riae, Beda sic progreditur, lib. II, cap. 4)",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "His temporibus venit a Mellitus Londoniae episco- pus Romam, de necessariis Ecclesiae Anglorum cau- sis cum apostolico papa Bonifacio tractaturus.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et cum idem papa reverendissimus cogeret synodum episcoporum Italiae, de vita monachorum et quiete ordinaturus, et ipse Mellitus inter eos assedit anno octavo imperii Phocatis principis;",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "indictione decima a Extra moenia Londini civitatis recens erat ex- structum monasterium, pro cujus regulari observan- tia Mellitus plurimum sollicitus Romam se contule- rat,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut pote quod illud ipsum fore sciret, si bene custodiretur, amplum seminarium, ex quo omnes Ecclesiae quae erant in Anglia sibi antistites adseisce- rent.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "His accedebat alia causa, quae et potissima vi- deri poterat, an nimirum rata sit habenda ecclesiae Sancti Petri ejusdem monasterii dedicatio divinitus facta,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "de qua plura valde miranda refert Ealredus abbas, scriptor gravissimus in vita sancti Eduardi regis Anglorum, apud Surium die quinta Januarii.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vide Baronium anno 610 numero 10. BINIUS. b Illud idem decretum synodale a Bonifacio IV papa promulgatum in concilio Romano anno 610 hic describimus ex veteri codice S.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Symphoriani Meten- sis qui modo visitur in Bibliotheca v. c. Claudii Hardy Parisiensis senatoris eruditissimi :",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quod cum ab Holsteniano in quibusdam plurimum differre ani- madverterim, ambigendum mihi non putavi quid illud etiam tibi, lector, offerrem :",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ex concilio sancti Bonifacii papae, qui quartus a beato Gregorio fuit : quod liceat monachis ubiubi cum sacerdotali officio celebrare.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sunt nonnulli stulti dogmatis, magis zelo amaritu- dinis quam dilectionis inflammati, asserentes monachos, quia mundo mortui sunt, et Deo vivunt,",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sacerdotali officio indignos, neque poenitentiam, aut Christianita- tem, seu absolutionem largiri posse per sacerdotalis officii injunctam gratiam, sed omnino falluntur.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam si ex hac causa veteres aemuli vera praedicarent, apo- stolicae sedis compar beatus Gregarius monachico pol- lens cultu, ad summum apicem nullatenus conscenderit, cui solvendi ligandique potestas concessa est.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Augusti- nus quoque ejusdem sanctissimi Gregorii discipulus Anglorum praedicator egregius, et Pannoniensis Mar- tinus,",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "aliique quamplurimi viri sanctissimi pretiosorum monachorum habitu fulgentes nequaquam annulo pon- tificali subtraherentur.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Neque enim Benedictus mona- chorum praeceptor hujus rei aliquo modo fuit inter- dictor, sed eos saecularium negotiorum dixit expertes esse debere :",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quod quidem apostolicis documentis et sanctorum Patrum institutis, non solum universis, verum etiam canonicis summopere imperatur.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Utrisque enim perspicacibus sanctorum Patrum exemplis, ut mundo mortui sint praecipitur.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Credimus igitur a sa- cerdotibus monachis ligandi solvendique officium digne administrari, si tamen digne contigerit eos hoc mi- nisterio sublimari.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod evidenter affirmat quisquis statum monachorum et habitum considerat; angelus enim Graece, Latine nuntius dicitur.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sacerdotes igitur monachi atque canonici, qui Dei praecepta annuntiant, angeli vocantur :",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s22",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed unusquisque angelicus ordo, quanto vicinius Dominum contemplantur, tanto subli- mius dignitate firmantur.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s23",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s23",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nunquid non ut cherubim monachi sex alis velantur : duae in capitio, que caput tegitur, veris demonstrantur assertionibus.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s24",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s24",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Illud vero quod brachiis extenditur duas alas esse dicimus, et illud quo corpus conditur, alas duas. Sic sex alarum numerus certissime conficitur.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s25",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s25",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Decertantes igitur con- tra monachos in hac re sacerdotalis potentiae arcere officio praecipimus, ut ab hujuscemodi nefandis ausibus in posterum reprimantur quia quanto quisque excelsior, tanto potentior.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s26",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s26",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LABBAEUS. * Verba sunt Binii. Infra autem habes illud decretum a Mansi editum.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo#PL80.BO.5.s27",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/bonifatius-iv/pl80_16_bo",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.BO.5.s27",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "tertia, tertia die Kalendarum Martiarum, ut quaeque erant regulariter decreta sua quoque auctoritate sub- scribens confirmaret, ac in Britanniam rediens, secum Anglorum Ecclesiae mandata atque observanda de- ferret,",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 611,
    "date_range": [
      608,
      615
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
